  videoWalkthroughUrl: https://unitycodemonkey.teachable.com/courses/problem-solving/lectures/64202445
  exerciseText: "Equipment System where the player can select an Active Equipment
    and run its logic, or press a button to select another equipment.\n \nIn this
    Scenario, the player can press 1 or 2 to select either the Bow or the Pickaxe.
    The Bow fires arrows and the Pickaxe can gather resources.\n\n<b>NOTE: Completing
    this Exercise will DELETE all the files, so if you want to keep your own personal
    implementation of this System then make a BACKUP before clicking on Complete
    Exercise!</b>"
